# Guoshui 2026 水中巡游：四个过门合并模型。
# 单位：米；NED 坐标，池底 Z=1.30，Z 增大表示向池底。
# OBJ groups: GateLow1, GateHigh1, GateLow2, GateHigh2.
# Red opening: width 0.70 m x height 0.50 m; pipe radius 0.020 m.
# Low-gate centres are 0.45 m above the pool floor; high-gate centres are 0.65 m above it.
# All faces are triangles and all normals are explicit to avoid Stonefish long-spike artifacts.
